cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data, please cite them as below and credit: Source: PlayerSells (https://playersells.com)"
type: dataset
title: "PlayerSells Open Data: aggregate measurements of social and streaming platforms"
abstract: >-
  Aggregate measurements collected by PlayerSells with its own crawlers:
  follower count percentiles on seven platforms, Kick and Twitch category
  viewing shares and simulcasting, Telegram subscriber change and reach
  benchmarks, and X (Twitter) reach and engagement benchmarks. Every figure is
  also published on playersells.com.
authors:
